        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Detached four bedroom cottage.\r\nOverlooking Woodford River.\r\nExtending to approximately 144 sq. m (1,550 sq. ft).\r\nIn need of refurbishment.\r\nOil fired central heating.\r\nLocated approximately 5km from Ballyconnell town.\r\nOn a site area extending to approximately 0.11 hectares (0.27 acres).\r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nThis property provides a four bedroom detached cottage overlooking Woodford River. The accommodation comprises an open plan kitchen/living/dining room, utility, storeroom, lounge, bedroom, & bathroom. The stairs leads to the first floor which consists of landing area, three bedrooms & storage/hot press. The property benefits from side access and enclosed rear garden. Local amenities can be accessed in nearby Ballyconnell town and include a wide range of shops, schools, bars, restaurants & sports clubs.\r\n\r\nVacant possession"
